to live in. From master bedrooms with oil-bound distemper finishing to spacious living areas, every aspect of the home is designed to provide utmost comfort and luxury. With various unit options to choose from, you can select the one that best suits your needs and budget.\n\nInvest in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, a property that offers a winning combination of quality, location, and amenities. Whether you are a first-time buyer or an investor, this project is sure to provide you with excellent returns on your investment. With RERA registration number P51800035115, you can rest assured of the project s authenticity and legality. Don t miss this opportunity to be a part of this exceptional residential project.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 417 | 1.30 Cr |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 488 | 1.52 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 659 | 2.05 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 739 | 2.30 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 932 | 2.90 Cr |\n\nThis residential project is situated near several notable landmarks, offering residents a unique blend of convenience, comfort, and amenities. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also provide easy access to essential services.\n\nIn resale we have 14 properties available ranging from 1 BHK - 3 BHK having price from 1.30 CR - 3.16 CR\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 14 | 1 BHK - 3 BHK | 1.30 CR - 3.16 CR |\n\nRecent government-registered transactions in the real estate market reveal a consistent rental rate of 26,830 over the past three and six months, indicating stability in the market. However, examining the price movement, a subtle decline is observed, with a reduction of 1,758 in the past three months and 2,550 in the past six months. On a more broader scale, looking at the past year, the rental rate remains consistent, while sales transactions have increased, with 4 government-registered deals worth a combined gross sales value of 9 Cr, signifying a significant shift in the market dynamics, despite a price movement of 4,625 over the same period.\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  417 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.49 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  488 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.74 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  659 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.35 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  739 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.64 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  932 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.32 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nShivoham Avyukta Neelkamal's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 39750 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 25100 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 25450 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 23400 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nShivoham Avyukta Neelkamal avg. price is ₹ 39.8 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal** | ₹ 39,750 |\n| [Dosti Oro 67](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/dosti-oro-67/105339/project \"Dosti Oro 67\") | ₹ 31,100 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Kolte Patil Vaayu](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-vaayu/105334/project \"Kolte Patil Vaayu\") | ₹ 30,700 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal moved from ₹ 25,100/sqft to ₹ 39,750/sqft, reflecting a 58.37% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nExternal Works has reached 97%.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal moved from ₹ 23,400/sqft to ₹ 25,450/sqft, reflecting a 8.76% rise.\n\nMEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 95% done.\n\nExternal Works has reached 97%, Internal finishing stands at 50%.\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion.\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 1 BHK 417 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shivoham-avyukta-neelkamal-apartment-1-bhk-417sqft-20221101161107.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.49 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 488 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.74 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 659 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shivoham-avyukta-neelkamal-apartment-2-bhk-659sqft-20222301162343.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.35 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 739 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shivoham-avyukta-neelkamal-apartment-2-bhk-739sqft-20222401162432.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.64 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 932 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/shivoham-avyukta-neelkamal-apartment-3-bhk-931sqft-20222501162505.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.32 Cr\n\n## Resale Listings in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Smita Shah]()\n\nEst8 Lab\n\n## Master