## What is the price range of units in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\nThe price range of units in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal is 1.30 Cr to 3.16 Cr, depending on the unit type and area size.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/avyukta-neelkamal-borivali-west/28925","title":"Avyukta Neelkamal, Borivali (West) — RERA & Possession | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Avyukta Neelkamal](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/28925/28925-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800035115RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Avyukta Neelkamal\n\n[Shivoham Associates](/builder/shivoham-associates)\n\n📍 Borivali (West), Mumbai Suburban · 400092\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Primary inventory recorded**\n\nAsk an advisor to verify current developer inventory and price.\n\nSource stage: Under Construction · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nAvyukta Neelkamal is a Project by Shivoham Group. It is located at Borivali West. Just 500 m from Metro station, 10 minutes to Borivali station. 300 m from Jain Derasar and temples. Also walking distance from hospitals, schools, college, east west flyover etc. 10 minutes from national park. It is a 22 storey tower offering 1,2 and 3 BHK Residences. Has all modern internal and external amenities. It is a RERA approved project. Builder possession is expected by 2025.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n14% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Borivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹31,200/sqft\n\nmedian · 29 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹88.7/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.4%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹34,500/sqft** — **11% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nSep 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 BHK417–488 ft²₹1.44 Cr–₹1.68 Cr\n\n2 BHK659–739 ft²₹2.27 Cr–₹2.55 Cr\n\n3 BHK932 ft²₹3.22 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Avyukta%20Neelkamal%20(RERA%20P51800035115))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800035115\n\nRegistered\n\n2022-05-10\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nICICI BANK LIMITED\n\nArchitect\n\nS Arc Architects\n\nTotal FSI\n\n9375\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nAvyukta Neelkamal27 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Borivali (West)  \n19.153823100000000,72.875178600000000\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nShivoham AssociatesNA\n\nH M Jhaveri and SonsArchitect\n\nSUNIL JAINArchitect\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n1 BHK417 ft²₹1.44 Cr—\n\n2 BHK659 ft²₹2.27 Cr—\n\n2 BHK739 ft²₹2.53 Cr—\n\n3 BHK931 ft²₹3.19 Cr—\n\n09\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n98% avg\n\nBasement (if any)100%\n\nExcavation100%\n\nExternal plumbing and external plaster, elevation, completion of terraces with waterproofing of the Building / wing.100%\n\nInternal walls, Intemal Plaster, Floorings, Floors and windows within Flats/Premises100%\n\nPlinth100%\n\nPodiums (if any) 100%\n\nSlabs of Super Structure100%\n\nStaircases, Lifts Wells and Lobbies at each Floor level Overhead and Underground Water Tanks100%\n\nStilt Floor 100%\n\nInstallation of Lifts, water pumps, Fire Fighting Fittings and Equipment as per CFO NOC, Electrical fittings, mechanical equipment, compliance to conditions ofenvironment/CRZ NOC, Finishing to entrance lobby/s, plinth protection. paving of areas appurtenant to Building/Wing, Compound Wall and all other requirements as may be required to complete project as per specifications in agreement of Sale.90%\n\nSanitary Fittings within the flats / premises90%\n\n10\n\n## Amenities\n\nSwimming PoolKids Play AreaGardenClubhouseIndoor GamesGymnasiumJogging TrackYoga Room24x7 SecurityVideo Door PhoneFire SafetyPower BackupParkingVisitor ParkingConcealed WiringConcealed Plumbing\n\n12\n\n## Talk to our MahaRERA advisor\n\n🏠 Discuss what you're looking for📍 Locality & project guidance🤝 Speak to a specialist\n\nTell our MahaRERA advisor what you need and they'll guide you on this project.\n\n[💬 Verify current project inventory](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Avyukta%20Neelkamal%20(RERA%20P51800035115))\n\n08\n\n## Property Rates in Borivali (West)\n\nResidential · Sale\n\n₹30,000–50,000/sqft\n\nCommercial · Sale\n\n₹30,00