ENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Avyukta%20Neelkamal%20(RERA%20P51800035115))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Avyukta%20Neelkamal%20(RERA%20P51800035115))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Borivali (West) — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nCodename Capital World, Thane West\n\nNew launch in Thane West — ₹14,382/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/avyukta-neelkamal","title":"Avyukta Neelkamal In Borivali West | Buy 1, 2 & 3 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nShivoham Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shivoham-group-avyukta-neelkamal-elevation-1733221953.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shivoham-group-avyukta-neelkamal-elevation-1733221964.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shivoham-group-avyukta-neelkamal-elevation-1733221993.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shivoham-group-avyukta-neelkamal-elevation-1733222007.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/shivoham-group-avyukta-neelkamal-elevation-1733222018.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200923024041-newproject-77.webp)\n\n# Avyukta Neelkamal\n\nAvyukta Neelkamal, DD Borge Marg, Van Udyan Rd, Gandhi Nagar, Eksar Dongri, Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400091\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹1.09 Cr - 2.44 Cr\n\n₹1.09 Cr - 2.44 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nWelcome to Avyukta Neelkamal, where aspirations meet world-class design and luxury redefined. Nestled in the heart of Borivali West, this premium residential landmark by Shivoham Group is a true epitome of urban elegance. Offering thoughtfully crafted 1, 2 & 3 BHK apartments, the project combines tasteful style, modern specifications, and seamless connectivity. With convenient roadways, proximity to top institutions, entertainment hubs, and lush green spaces, Avyukta Neelkamal delivers the perfect blend of city life and tranquility. Enhanced by an array of lifestyle amenities, it’s more than a home it’s your vision of luxury brought to life.\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Sep 2026\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹26,210/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n417 - 931 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Experience opulent living in a forward-thinking locale.\n* Meticulously designed with intelligence.\n* A representation of the highest level of eloquence.\n* It stands as a distinguished landmark, more than just an address.\n\n* Cherish quality time with your family and find delight in unseen care.\n* Architectural focus on innovative design.\n* Perfection is an innate quality.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nOnline Reviews Summary The project generally receives positive feedback for its strategic location and construction efficiency. Residents and prospective buyers appreciate the proximity to public transport hubs and essential services. Reviews highlight the spaciousness of the single-bedroom units compared to market standards, though some mention the lack of luxury leisure facilities and balconies as drawbacks for a project in this price bracket. +1\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Connectivity\n\nThe site is situated within walking distance of the Borivali West Metro Station and is close to the Borivali Railway Station.\n\nEfficient Design\n\nApartments are noted for having zero wastage in floor plans, ensuring maximum utilization of the carpet area.\n\nSpacious Small Units\n\nThe project offers 1BHK configurations with larger-than-average carpet areas, which is a rare find in the local market.\n\nProximity to Amenities\n\nEducational institutions like St. Lawrence High School and healthcare facilities like Apex Superspeciality Hospital are in the immediate vicinity.\n\nPeaceful Environment\n\nLocated in Govind Nagar, the project offers a relatively tranquil living experience while remaining in the heart of the suburb.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nLack of Balconies\n\nThe architectural design does not include private balconies, which may be a deterrent for those seeking outdoor space.\n\nBasic Amenities\n\nThe project focuses on essential facilities and lacks high-end luxury features such as a swimming pool or a large clubhouse.\n\nLimited Open Space\n\nBeing a single-tower development on a 0.85-acre plot, there is limited internal open area for recreation.\n\nHigh Entry Cost\n\nProperty prices in this specific pocket of Borivali West are high, making it a significant investment for middle-income buyers.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for commuters\n\nEfficient for nuclear families\n\nHigh value for space seekers\n\nAvoid if luxury amenities are a priority\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/Car-Parking-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Car-Parking-secondary.svg)\n\nCar Parking Space\n\n![amenities/Chess-And-Carrom-Room-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Chess-And-Carrom-Room-secondary.svg)\n\nChess and Carrom Room\n\n![amenities/Fitness-Center-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Fitness-Center-secondary.svg)\n\nFitness Center\n\n![amenities/High-Speed-Elevators-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/High-Speed-Elevators-secondary.svg)\n\nHigh Speed Elevator\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jacuzzi-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jacuzzi-secondary.svg)\n\nJacuzzi\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/l