ge of Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Avyukta Neelkamal is 417 - 931 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Avyukta Neelkamal is ₹1.09 Cr - 2.44 Cr\n\n### Where is Avyukta Neelkamal located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAvyukta Neelkamal is located at Avyukta Neelkamal, DD Borge Marg, Van Udyan Rd, Gandhi Nagar, Eksar Dongri, Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400091.\n\n### What configurations are available in Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nAvyukta Neelkamal has 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Avyukta Neelkamal is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Car Parking Space, Chess and Carrom Room, Fitness Center, High Speed Elevator, Indoor Games, Jacuzzi, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Open Air Party Area, Party Lawn, Yoga Area, Zumba and Dance Floor.\n\n### Who is the developer of Avyukta Neelkamal?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Avyukta Neelkamal is Shivoham Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Avyukta Neelkamal:Shivoham Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200923024041-newproject-77.webp)\n\n## Shivoham Group\n\nShivoham Group is committed to helping individuals find their ideal homes that meet their needs and budget requirements. They prioritize listening to customers' suggestions and requirements to select the best architectural designs, ensuring safety, practicality, and modern amenities are fundamental aspect