ham Group](/builder/shivoham-group)|\n\nGovind Nagar, [Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\n₹2.27 Cr - 2.40 Cr All inc.\n\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shivoham_Avyukta_Neelkamal_Elevation--1717764564753-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shivoham_Avyukta_Neelkamal_Elevation---1717764591700-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shivoham_Avyukta_Neelkamal_Elevation_--1717764591854-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shivoham_Avyukta_Neelkamal_Elevation_Front_View--1717764592267-img-1280w.webp)\n\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Shivoham_Avyukta_Neelkamal_Elevation_Top_View--1717764592493-img-1280w.webp)\n\n3+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n0.85 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n3P+G+23\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n417-931 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800035115\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nReady To Move\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nApr 2026\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNov 2026\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal\n\nShivoham Borivali West Project Overview  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Project will be constructed on 0.85 Acre of land parcel, 1 tower with 3P+G+23 floors having 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Location  \nProject is located On JK Paradise Rd, Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai with -  \nCroma - 1.3km  \nDon Bosco Metro Stn - 1.3km  \nBorivali Railway Station - 1.5km  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Borivali West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, SS sink, CCTV & many more  \n  \nShivoham Group Borivali West External Amenities  \nProject has 15+ amenities with likes of -  \nKids Play Area  \nBox Cricket  \nFitness Studio  \nGymnasium  \nYoga Zone many more  \n  \nShivoham Group Neelkamal Borivali West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Possession -  \nRera Possession - Nov 2026  \nTarget Possession - Ready To Move  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Mumbai project has 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n1BHK - (417 - 488) sqft  \n2BHK - (659 to 739) sqft  \n3BHK - 931 sqft  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal floor plan  \nAvyukta Neelkamal floor plan will have 4 flats 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Borivali West project sample flat is ready to view at the site  \n  \nAvyukta Neelkamal Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Avyukta Neelkamal Borivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Shivoham Group Borivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Location\n\nOn JK Paradise Rd, Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n* Croma - 1.3km\n* Don Bosco Metro Stn - 1.3km\n* Borivali Railway Station - 1.5km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Videos\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is situated in a prime location near Devidas Road, offering excellent connectivity to the metro, railway station, malls, and other key conveniences.\n\n2.Optimized Unit Plan – The 1BHK apartments, with carpet areas of 417 and 488 sq. ft., are efficiently designed with zero wastage, allowing residents to utilize 100% of the usable space.\n\n3.The project offers a generously sized 1BHK with a carpet area of 488 sq. ft., which is a rare find in today’s market where most developers focus on compact layouts. If spacious living is your preference, this project is an ideal choice.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The apartments do not include balconies, so if having a balcony is a priority for you, this project may not be the right fit.\n\n2.The project offers only basic amenities and lacks features like a swimming pool or clubhouse. So, if premium amenities are important to you, this project may not meet your expectations.\n\n## Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Video Door Phone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652436636760-img.jpeg)\n\nVideo Door Phone\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n![CCTV Camera](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/cctv-camera_External_1770712182845-897978997.webp)\n\nCCTV Camera\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Garden](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/garden_External_1770724836898-39687774.webp)\n\nGarden\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Skating Rink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/skating-rink_External_1770790061957-226008195.webp)\n\nSkating Rink\n\n![Steam Room](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447014345-img.webp)\n\nSteam Room\n\n![Outdoor Chess](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652445523684-i