code_1742130851824-422447365.webp)\n\nP51800035115](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/36368)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Shivoham Group\n\nShivoham Group\n\n![Shivoham Group](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/KIGI--1717761948567-img.webp)\n\n2 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburban\n\n15 yearsExperience\n\n12Total Projects\n\n4K+Happy Families\n\n\"Shivoham Group is the latest of business enterprises which was first incepted in the year 1947 as a trading concern “Shree Shanti” by late Mr. Dalichand Jain and late Mrs. Badamiben Dalichand Jain when India celebrated its independence from the rule of the British Kingdom. From humble beginning Mr. Tejraj D. Jain has painstakingly and devotedly built the Shivoham Group and has till date completed many building projects with the support of a dedicated team of engineers, architects, advisers and consultants. \"\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 2BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 November 2026** as per RERA. Construction is currently **100%** complete as of July 14, 2026. Target possession is **01 April 2026**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800035115**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/36368>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800035115**.\n\nThis project offers **24+** amenities. Key external amenities include Fitness Studio, Walking Track, Terrace Garden, Gymnasium, and Yoga Deck.  \n Internal specifications include CCTV Camera and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, the 1BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **417 sq. ft.**  \n• **488 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **659 sq. ft.**  \n• **694 sq. ft.**  \n• **739 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **931 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal starts from **₹1.50 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **417 sq. ft.** – ₹1.50 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **488 sq. ft.** – ₹1.50 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal starts from **₹2.27 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **659 sq. ft.** – ₹2.27 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **694 sq. ft.** – ₹2.40 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **739 sq. ft.** – ₹2.53 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal starts from **₹3.30 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **931 sq. ft.** – ₹3.30 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.85 acres** with **1** towers with **3P+G+23** floors. Each floor has **4** flats per floor, **2** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **1BHK/2BHK/3BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **417** to **931 sq. ft.**\n\nShivoham Avyukta Neelkamal provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **On JK Paradise Rd, Govind Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Croma - 1.3km**   \n**• Don Bosco Metro Stn - 1.3km**   \n**• Borivali Railway Station - 1.5km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹23.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Shivoham Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **15 years** of experience and more than **12 completed projects** across **Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban**.\n\nYes, the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey. You can download them from the Documents section or verify them on the RERA portal.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Borivali West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Shivoham Group** - with 15 years of experience - offers 1BHK/2BHK/3BHK at ₹1.50 Cr to ₹3.30 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Fre